[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 129 Seventy miles an hour Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.67,
    "end": 11.391,
    "zh": "第129课 每小时七十英里 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第129課 每小時七十英里 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "What does Ann advise",
    "start": 12.316,
    "end": 14.697,
    "zh": "安建议",
    "zh_hant": "安建議"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "her husband to do next time?",
    "start": 14.347,
    "end": 17.398,
    "zh": "她丈夫下次做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "她丈夫下次做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Look, Gary!",
    "start": 19.3,
    "end": 20.76,
    "zh": "看，加里！",
    "zh_hant": "看，加里！"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "That policeman's waving to you.",
    "start": 21.061,
    "end": 24.202,
    "zh": "那个警察在向你挥手。",
    "zh_hant": "那個警察在向你揮手。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "He wants you to stop.",
    "start": 24.442,
    "end": 26.763,
    "zh": "他想让你停下来。",
    "zh_hant": "他想讓你停下來。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Where do you think you are?",
    "start": 27.924,
    "end": 31.005,
    "zh": "你以为你在哪儿？",
    "zh_hant": "你以為你在哪兒？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "On a race track?",
    "start": 31.306,
    "end": 33.046,
    "zh": "在赛道上吗？",
    "zh_hant": "在賽道上嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "You must have been driving",
    "start": 33.547,
    "end": 35.848,
    "zh": "你一定是",
    "zh_hant": "你一定是"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "at seventy miles an hour.",
    "start": 35.528,
    "end": 38.449,
    "zh": "以每小时七十英里的速度开车。",
    "zh_hant": "以每小時七十英里的速度開車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I can't have been.",
    "start": 38.989,
    "end": 40.891,
    "zh": "我不可能开那么快。",
    "zh_hant": "我不可能開那麼快。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I was doing eighty when I overtook you.",
    "start": 41.971,
    "end": 45.533,
    "zh": "我超过你时是每小时八十英里。",
    "zh_hant": "我超過你時是每小時八十英里。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Didn't you see the speed limit?",
    "start": 46.354,
    "end": 49.195,
    "zh": "你没看到限速标志吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你沒看到限速標誌嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I'm afraid I didn't, officer.",
    "start": 49.795,
    "end": 52.556,
    "zh": "恐怕我没看到，警官。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕我沒看到，警官。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I must have been dreaming.",
    "start": 52.857,
    "end": 55.078,
    "zh": "我一定是在做梦。",
    "zh_hant": "我一定是在做夢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "He wasn't dreaming, officer.",
    "start": 55.958,
    "end": 58.779,
    "zh": "他没做梦，警官。",
    "zh_hant": "他沒做夢，警官。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "I was telling him to drive slowly.",
    "start": 59.06,
    "end": 62.982,
    "zh": "我刚才在告诉他开慢点。",
    "zh_hant": "我剛才在告訴他開慢點。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "That's why I didn't see the sign.",
    "start": 63.382,
    "end": 66.503,
    "zh": "所以我没看到标志。",
    "zh_hant": "所以我沒看到標誌。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Let me see your driving licence.",
    "start": 67.804,
    "end": 70.665,
    "zh": "让我看看你的驾照。",
    "zh_hant": "讓我看看你的駕照。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "I won't charge you this time.",
    "start": 71.806,
    "end": 74.507,
    "zh": "这次我不罚你。",
    "zh_hant": "這次我不罰你。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "But you'd better not do it again!",
    "start": 74.668,
    "end": 77.869,
    "zh": "但你最好别再这样了！",
    "zh_hant": "但你最好別再這樣了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Thank you.",
    "start": 78.43,
    "end": 79.16,
    "zh": "谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I'll certainly be more careful.",
    "start": 78.76,
    "end": 82.654,
    "zh": "我一定会更小心的。",
    "zh_hant": "我一定會更小心的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "I told you to drive slowly, Gary.",
    "start": 83.556,
    "end": 87.119,
    "zh": "我告诉过你开慢点，加里。",
    "zh_hant": "我告訴過你開慢點，加里。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "You always tell me to drive slowly, darling.",
    "start": 87.42,
    "end": 91.684,
    "zh": "你总是叫我开慢点，亲爱的。",
    "zh_hant": "你總是叫我開慢點，親愛的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Well, next time you'd",
    "start": 91.765,
    "end": 94.928,
    "zh": "嗯，下次你最好",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，下次你最好"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "better take my advice!",
    "start": 94.578,
    "end": 97.11,
    "zh": "听我的建议！",
    "zh_hant": "聽我的建議！"
  }
]
